.DS_Store

# Profiles are generated by the engine on first creation and differ per person
# (clone names, icons and paths are all personal choices) — local state, not
# version-controlled.
# Field documentation lives in profiles/example.conf.sample, whose suffix is
# deliberately not .conf, or --list and --all would treat it as a real clone.
profiles/*.conf

# Note: icons/ IS tracked — new users rely on it to try the flow, and the README
# presents it that way.
